  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 7 ranks, Subterfuge sphere.</p>\n<p>If you would be reduced below 0 hit points or killed by hit point damage, you may reveal this plan as an immediate action to discreetly use a potion or other item that heals hit points. You can reveal having spent the money to purchase the item as part of revealing the plan. Apply the healing before the damage. If you avoid falling below 0 hit points, you can still appear dead for 1 minute, after which you regain 1 hp and become conscious (unless healed sooner).</p>\n<p>A character who succeeds at a Heal check (DC 10 + your Disguise modifier) or who uses an ability such as deathwatch can tell that you are not dead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/subterfuge#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
